      565.06,
      297.79,
      688.13
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of below mentioned land Lot 01 depicted in the Advance Tracing No. CO/HMG/2021/429 dated of 26.02.2022 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Kiriwaththuduwa (Within the limits of Homagama Pradeshiya Sabha) in Grama Niladhari Division of 603 C - Munamale Yakahaluwa in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Homagama in Colombo District in the Western Province and described in below names and extents as follows:",
